WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.140
A farm gate, with a painted name board.

2
00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:06.480
Chapter 2: the animals
drive out their farmer,

3
00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:08.190
and paint over the name.

4
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.310
Seasons flash past.

5
00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:11.410
A harvest.

6
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.500
Snow.

7
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.510
A windmill, half built.

8
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:18.270
Then, in Chapter 10, a
figure repaints the board,

9
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:19.970
back to its old name.

10
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.380
The farm ends where it began.

11
00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:23.990
So what changed?

12
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.600
In this mission, you'll see how
Orwell builds a beast fable,

13
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.600
in ten short chapters.

14
00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.380
You'll learn how a story about
animals can stand for real history,

15
00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:35.200
and for more besides.

16
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.430
And you'll trace the
story's shape: a rise,

17
00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.420
a turn, and a fall.

18
00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:43.630
Your mission: work out
what really changed.
